<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Amaday PL | Advanced Dual-Action Therapy</title>
    <style>
        /* Modern Minimalist Reset & Variables */
        :root {
            --primary: #005A9C;
            --primary-dark: #003D6B;
            --text-dark: #222222;
            --text-muted: #666666;
            --bg-light: #F8FAFC;
            --white: #FFFFFF;
            --border: #E2E8F0;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            color: var(--text-dark);
            background-color: var(--white);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Layout Structure */
        header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 20px 8%;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
            background: var(--white);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }

        .cta-btn {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: background 0.2s ease;
        }

        .cta-btn:hover {
            background-color: var(--primary-dark);
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            background-color: var(--bg-light);
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 40px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-text h1 {
            font-size: 42px;
            line-height: 1.2;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero-text p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-image {
            width: 100%;
            height: 350px;
            background-color: #E0E7FF;
            border-radius: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: var(--primary);
            font-weight: 600;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
        }

        /* Pillars Section */
        .features {
            padding: 80px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .section-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
        }

        .grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 30px;
        }

        .card {
            padding: 30px;
            border: 1px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            background: var(--white);
            text-align: left;
        }

        .card h3 {
            font-size: 20px;
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .card p {
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* Trust & Compliance Banner */
        .trust-banner {
            background-color: var(--primary);
            color: var(--white);
            padding: 40px 8%;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .trust-banner p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            padding: 40px 8%;
            border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-muted);
        }

        /* Responsive Breakpoints */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                text-align: center;
                padding: 50px 5%;
            }
            header {
                padding: 15px 5%;
            }
            .features {
                padding: 50px 5%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="logo">AMADAY PL</div>
        <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn">Request Information</a>
    </header>

    <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-text">
            <h1>Targeted Efficacy. Unshakeable Foundation.</h1>
            <p>Amaday PL delivers dual-action clinical stability engineered to support optimal patient outcomes and consistent daily treatment management.</p>
            <a href="#contact" class="cta-btn">View Clinical Summary</a>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-image">
            [ High-Resolution Product / Visual Aid Placeholder ]
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features">
        <h2 class="section-title">Key Brand Pillars</h2>
        <div class="grid">
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Dual-Action Synergy</h3>
                <p>Combines complementary mechanisms into a streamlined therapeutic approach for comprehensive patient management.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Bioequivalent Quality</h3>
                <p>Formulated to strictly meet high quality standards, ensuring predictable therapeutic performance.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="card">
                <h3>Adherence-Focused</h3>
                <p>Designed to simplify administration regimes, promoting consistent long-term treatment compliance.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section class="trust-banner">
        <h2>Approved Quality Standard</h2>
        <p>Fully compliant with regulatory requirements and clinical quality specifications.</p>
    </section>

    <footer id="contact">
        <p><strong>Amaday PL</strong> &copy; 2026. All Rights Reserved.</p>
        <p style="margin-top: 8px;">For healthcare professional inquiries only. Prescribing information available upon request.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
